:''Maximum energy total increased!''
The '''Dark Matter''' is one of the [[Cats of the Cosmos]] [[Treasure]]s. It increases the player's [[Cat Energy]] limit. Like all Treasures, it is able to stack with others, specifically the [[Management Bible]], the [[Future Tech]], and other Dark Matters.

==Effect==
Each Dark Matter increases Max [[Cat Energy]] by a maximum +30.

When a player has activated Dark Matter at 100% in all three chapters, Max Cat Energy is increased by +90.

